arbeitnow:senior-software-engineer-brist:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Bristol, London or Edinburgh (hybrid, three days a week in the office)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Level: Senior Engineer II (TL1)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team: Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contract: Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting To: Software Engineering Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Kaluza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a technology community of product-focused and data-led product and platform engineers working at scale. We have a diverse ecosystem, spanning TypeScript on AWS, Go on GCP and Scala, we index on product-minded problem solving over language purity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Engineer you’ll own a slice of the product end-to-end, from design through to production, and you’ll build AI coding agents as your default. We’re looking for someone whose judgement is worth more than their typing speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From your first day you’ll have paid access to Claude Code, with a budget we don’t ration, and access to the systems you need through MCP. Our tools and conventions evolve quickly, and you’ll directly impact how we build from here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a slice of the product end to end: &lt;/strong&gt;shape the problem with product and design, build the interface and the services behind it, ship it, and run it in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work across the stack over time&lt;/strong&gt;: depending on the team you’ll work across the interface people use, the services behind it, and the APIs between them, in whatever stack your team runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build with AI coding agents as your default&lt;/strong&gt;: Break work down so agents can execute, direct them, and review their output as carefully as you’d review a colleague’s pull request. You’ll also maintain the tests and safeguards that let agent written code merge safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay close to the people who use what you build: &lt;/strong&gt;directly or through our forward-deployed engineers: a supplier’s operations team, a customer plugging in a car at night. Instrument what you ship so you can see how it’s used, and turn what you learn into shipped changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make good work the default: &lt;/strong&gt;shape the codebase, conventions and automated checks so that agents and new teammates produce the right thing without anyone catching it in review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor the team around you:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach and mentor your peers and help improve how we work and evolve as a team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These are the practices and behaviours we see most in our top engineers and value deeply, but we don't expect everyone to tick every single box. If you're excited by the role and can see yourself thriving here, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience shipping production software:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a depth of experience in either a front-end or back-end of a modern stack, and potentially an openness to stretch across both as you navigate our diverse ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI coding tools:&lt;/strong&gt; You build with tools like Cursor or Claude Code, can walk us through work you’ve shipped this way and review AI output as rigorously as a colleague’s pull request.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Able to navigate a complex, high-stakes domain:&lt;/strong&gt; You keep complex energy logic legible across microservices, knowing exactly when to use sync vs async to prevent cascading failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud and operational ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You're comfortable deploying on major cloud platforms using shared tooling. You fully own your software in production, which includes participating in an out-of-hours on-call rota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong product sense.&lt;/strong&gt; You ask the “why” before building, and you can describe a time when user feedback or metrics changed what you shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear written communication.&lt;/strong&gt; You write specs, pull request descriptions and post-mortems with enough clarity and context that either a human teammate or an AI agent can immediately act on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A multiplier for your team:&lt;/strong&gt; You mentor peers and proactively shape how the team works; introducing conventions, checks or shared context that makes everyone else’s output consistently better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be great if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building tooling around coding agents, such as MCP servers, skills or CI checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in energy, or another real-time or regulated field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Five values guide how we work at Kaluza:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win:&lt;/strong&gt; Collective pride in decarbonising energy at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the real problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Cutting through complexity to focus on real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistency, transparency and doing what we say.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off and family:&lt;/strong&gt; 26 days’ holiday, plus 26 weeks’ full pay for new parents with no qualifying service period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and security:&lt;/strong&gt; Private medical insurance with virtual GP, life assurance, pension scheme, free mortgage advice and eye tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay and flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, a Flex Fund of 5% of salary to spend on the benefits you want most, retail discounts through Perks at Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and setup:&lt;/strong&gt; Personal learning budget, home office budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Climate:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to Furthr, our climate action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to meet people from all walks of life. The more inclusive we are, the better our work will be, and we recognise talent on merit and potential. If you’re excited about the role but don’t tick every box, we’d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires an existing right to work in the UK. We can’t offer visa sponsorship, but we review sponsorship role by role, so keep an eye on our careers site for future opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more on our&lt;a href="https://www.kaluza.com/careers/"&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/"&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. Our Applicant Data Protection Policy is&lt;a href="https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/"&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-principal-solution-engi:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Strength in Trust&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;OneTrust’s mission is to enable innovation through the responsible use of data and AI. We believe that ensuring data is trusted shouldn’t slow teams down—it should accelerate what’s possible. This led us to develop the first technology platform for responsible data use in 2016. Today, with AI representing the latest and most impactful expansion of data yet, OneTrust is once again redefining what responsible innovation looks like. OneTrust, the AI‑Ready Governance Platform™, unifies regulatory intelligence, automation, and connected governance workflows so businesses can continue to move at the speed of AI while ensuring good governance to prevent data misuse at scale. Trusted by thousands of organizations worldwide, OneTrust is shaping the future where trusted data becomes a transformative force for business and society.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Challenge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Principal Solutions Engineer to shape and lead technical strategy for OneTrust’s most strategic and complex opportunities in the UK &amp;amp; Ireland. Reporting to the Solutions Engineering Manager, you will bring broad portfolio fluency, deep enterprise technology expertise, executive-level customer engagement, and commercial judgement to help customers solve business-critical challenges with OneTrust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with Sales, Customer Success, Product, Engineering and partners to build deep account alignment, progress complex buying decisions, and create measurable customer and commercial outcomes. You will be a trusted advisor to senior customer stakeholders and a force multiplier for the Solutions Engineering organisation: setting s high bar, developing reusable approaches, and coaching others to raise the quality of our work. AI Governance is an important area of expertise for this role, alongside the breadth to lead opportunities across OneTrust’s entire platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical strategy for the highest-impact, most complex opportunities across OneTrust’s solutions portfolio, aligning the customer’s business priorities, technology environment, risk posture, architecture and decision process to the right OneTrust solutions and measurable outcomes. Bring particular depth in AI Governance where relevant to the customer’s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build deep account alignment with Account Executives, Customer Success and other partners. Map the buying group and executive sponsors; understand account priorities and whitespace; and shape a coordinated, multi-stakeholder motion that advances the opportunity and contributes to sustainable ACV growth. Partner with the commercial account owners on expansion strategy; this role does not replace their ownership of the customer relationship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage credibly with executive and practitioner stakeholders—including CIO/CTO, CISO, Chief AI and Data leaders, Privacy, Legal, Risk, Security, Procurement, and AI/ML Engineering—to connect governance requirements with business value and delivery realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery and solution design for complex enterprise programmes across relevant OneTrust solution areas, translating fragmented requirements, regulatory obligations and technical constraints into practical, scalable operating models, architectures and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring deep technical expertise in OneTrust’s solutions, enterprise integrations and the technology ecosystems relevant to each opportunity. Advise on APIs, data flows, identity and access, cloud and platform architecture, and—where relevant—AI/ML lifecycles and operational controls; identify risks and dependencies early; and recommend implementable designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead tailored demonstrations, technical evaluations, proofs of concept, RFP responses and executive presentations across the portfolio. Set clear success criteria, prove technical fit and business value, and use evaluation outcomes to build stakeholder confidence and progress the sales motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate OneTrust’s differentiated value and position solutions thoughtfully against alternatives, connecting customer requirements to the most relevant solution capabilities, integrations and roadmap—including AI Governance where applicable—without overpromising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic bridge between the field and Product, Engineering, Marketing and leadership. Bring structured customer and competitive insight to inform product direction, positioning, packaging and go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable solution patterns, account-planning practices, demos, technical guidance and field assets that improve consistency and outcomes beyond an individual opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor Solutions Engineers and cross-functional partners in portfolio knowledge, strategic discovery, technical storytelling, executive engagement and complex deal execution, sharing AI Governance expertise where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate opportunity strategy, technical risks, evaluation plans and next steps in Salesforce, in partnership with the account team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a trusted technical and strategic partner on the business’s most consequential opportunities across OneTrust’s solutions portfolio, improving deal progression and technical win outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build durable alignment across customer executives, practitioners and the OneTrust account team, connecting the right OneTrust solutions to funded priorities and demonstrable business value—including AI Governance where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your work contributes to healthy ACV growth by helping account teams identify, shape and win the right strategic opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customers see a credible path from their business priorities to operational outcomes, with connected, secure, scalable and realistic recommendations across the relevant OneTrust solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You raise the capability of the wider organisation through thought leadership, repeatable approaches, coaching and actionable customer insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic, customer-led thinker who starts with outcomes and discovery, navigates ambiguity, and exercises sound judgement rather than defaulting to a product pitch or a standard playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially astute: you understand how complex enterprise buying decisions are made, how technical strategy affects deal outcomes, and how to create mutual value without compromising customer trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An executive-level communicator who can move from technical depth to a concise business narrative, influence senior decision-makers, and adapt to different audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A broad portfolio strategist and a credible AI Governance expert, with a strong, current point of view on the AI landscape, associated technologies and fast-moving developments. You continuously assess what is emerging, what is becoming operationally relevant, and what it means for customer needs and OneTrust’s solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A technical authority and generous coach: you are a go-to resource on complex problems and actively build the expertise and confidence of others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A cross-functional leader who influences through expertise, brings teams together across geographies, and turns customer and market insight into broader organisational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable setting direction where the answer is not yet established, while being transparent about assumptions, trade-offs, product capabilities and limitations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Experience Includes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically 12+ years of relevant experience in Solutions Engineering, Solutions Consulting, technical sales or a comparable customer-facing enterprise technology role, including a track record of leading complex, strategic opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success shaping strategic sales motions through deep account alignment, executive engagement, multi-threaded discovery and value-based solution design—with evidence of contributing to ACV growth and technical wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across multiple enterprise solution areas, ideally spanning OneTrust domains such as privacy, AI Governance, data use governance, technology risk and compliance, third-party risk, and consent and preferences. You can connect solution areas into coherent customer outcomes; AI Governance is a required area of depth, but not the exclusive scope of the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in AI Governance and responsible AI, including practical understanding of AI system inventories, governance operating models, risk assessment, policy and controls, approvals, evidence and ongoing oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of AI technologies and architectures, including generative AI and large language models, AI agents, machine learning, third-party AI, model and application lifecycles, and the cloud services and platforms used to build and operate AI. You can assess new developments critically and translate their implications into customer guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of relevant governance and regulatory frameworks, such as the EU AI Act, NIST AI Risk Management Framework and ISO/IEC 42001, and the ability to connect requirements to operational processes and technical controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical grounding in enterprise SaaS, cloud computing, web applications, REST APIs, enterprise integrations, authentication and data flows. Experience with JavaScript or Python and practical scripting is valuable; familiarity with containers and Kubernetes is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and delivering enterprise software demonstrations, integrations and evaluations, including proofs of concept with clear business and technical success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to build trusted relationships and influence across customer organisations and internal teams, including Sales, Customer Success, Product, Engineering, Marketing and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Computer Science, Engineering or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel as required; estimated travel is approximately 25%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0"&gt;Where we Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are embracing an office-first culture, encouraging three days a week in office for most roles, with meaningful opportunities to collaborate and celebrate in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each role may have specific requirements or flexibility depending on the scope of the position, so we encourage you to verify this with your recruiter during your first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0"&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0"&gt;As an employee at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW202854797 BCX0"&gt;OneTrust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0"&gt;, you will be part of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW202854797 BCX0"&gt;OneTeam&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0"&gt;. That means &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0"&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0"&gt; receive support physically, mentally, and emotionally so that you can do your best work both in and out of the office. This includes comprehensive healthcare coverage, flexible PTO, equity RSUs, annual performance bonus opportunities, retirement account support, 14+ weeks of paid parental leave, career development opportunities, company-paid privacy certification exam fees, and much more. Specific benefits differ by country. For more information, talk to your recruiter or visit onetrust.com/careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Resources&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out the following to learn more about OneTrust and its people:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="fui-Link ___m14voj0 f3rmtva f1ern45e f1deefiw f1n71otn f1q5o8ev f1h8hb77 f1vxd6vx f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f9n3di6 f1ids18y fygtlnl f1deo86v f12x56k7 f1iescvh ftqa4ok f50u1b5 fs3pq8b f1hghxdh f1tymzes f1x7u7e9 f1cmlufx f10aw75t fsle3fq" href="https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTM-0khp0wIWkO-Bh3IfdSMMOi8606Tl0" target="_blank"&gt;OneTrust Careers on YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="fui-Link ___m14voj0 f3rmtva f1ern45e f1deefiw f1n71otn f1q5o8ev f1h8hb77 f1vxd6vx f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f9n3di6 f1ids18y fygtlnl f1deo86v f12x56k7 f1iescvh ftqa4ok f50u1b5 fs3pq8b f1hghxdh f1tymzes f1x7u7e9 f1cmlufx f10aw75t fsle3fq" href="https://www.instagram.com/lifeatonetrust/" target="_blank"&gt;@LifeatOneTrust on Instagram&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your Data&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have the right to have your personal data updated or removed. You also have the right to have a copy of the information OneTrust holds about you. Further details about these rights are available on the website in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://trustcenter-privacy.my.onetrust.com/policies/39803da3-9bb9-4709-afaf-2ba0a14d09ca?context=eyJkc1BvcnRhbElkIjoiZWM5MmYwZmEtYjFiNi00YzdlLWJmN2ItMDdlNTc2MTQyMGQxIn0%3D" target="_blank"&gt;Privacy Overview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You can change your mind at any time and have your personal data removed from our database. In order to do this you must contact us and let us know you wish to be removed. The request should be made on the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://privacyportal-cdn.onetrust.com/dsarwebform/37bcc497-a196-48f1-a08b-e897b5a77859/08a01c64-41fd-4b4e-9d42-cde44371a422.html"&gt;Data Subject Request Form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(224, 62, 45);"&gt;Recruitment fraud warning:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak"&gt;OneTrust is aware of scams involving false offers of employment with our company.&amp;nbsp;The fraudulent jobs, interviews and job offers use fake websites, email addresses, group chat and text messages. Be aware that we never ask candidates for personal information, IDs or bank information during the interview process. We do not interview prospective candidates via instant message or group chat, and do not require candidates to purchase products or services, or process payments on our behalf as a condition of any employment offer. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak"&gt;&lt;span class="ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak"&gt;Please note that any legitimate interview availability requests will come directly from a OneTrust recruiter with an ----- email address. You may also receive legitimate emails from ----- Recruiters will only reach out to candidates who have applied for a role through our ATS (Greenhouse) or prospects via LinkedIn InMail. Job offers will come from a recruiter and may have a ----- email address. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak"&gt;For more information or if you have been targeted please reach out to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(224, 62, 45);"&gt;&lt;span class="ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak"&gt;&lt;a ---------- class="ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 3"&gt;Our Commitment to You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;When you join OneTrust you are stepping onto a launching pad — the countdown has begun. The destination? A career without boundaries working alongside a diverse and inclusive crew who is passionate about doing meaningful work. As a pioneer, your voice and expertise will help chart the direction of an entirely new category. Our commitment to putting people first starts with you. Your growth is part of the mission. Our goal is to give you the power to embark on the next phase of your uniquely, unique career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;OneTrust provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by local laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-full-stack-software-dev:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We're looking for a Senior Software Engineer to join our Streams UI team, where you'll have the chance to shape and enhance our user interface, making it more intuitive and engaging for our users. In this role, you'll work on Fleet. Fleet is the central management experience for Elastic Agent in Kibana. You'll also work on Streams. Streams is our new tool for handling log data. This includes ingesting, organizing, parsing, enriching, and setting retention for the data. You will be part of a skilled group of engineers and designers. You will contribute your expertise and learn from others. If you enjoy tackling complex challenges and want to make a meaningful impact on our product, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="4ifbk" data-offset-key="4ui2f-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="4ui2f-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="4ui2f-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Design and implement intuitive user interface components that enhance user commitment, using TypeScript, React, and Node.js. Integrate front-end elements seamlessly with back-end services to ensure a smooth user experience. Conduct usability testing and gather user feedback to drive continuous improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="4ifbk" data-offset-key="80cku-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="80cku-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="80cku-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Own complex, loosely-defined problems end-to-end: shape the approach, split the work if needed, make the key technical decisions, and deliver.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="4ifbk" data-offset-key="ad2pt-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="ad2pt-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="ad2pt-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Lead discussions on architecture and system design. During these discussions, consider trade-offs. Also, think about backwards compatibility, performance, and scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="4ifbk" data-offset-key="e1619-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="e1619-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="e1619-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Establish coding standards and ensure the team adheres to them throughout the development process. Promote reusable components to improve efficiency and implement automated testing and deployment to maintain code quality. Evaluate new technologies for potential integration and document best practices to facilitate team-wide knowledge sharing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="4ifbk" data-offset-key="9s3kf-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="9s3kf-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="9s3kf-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Conduct thorough code reviews to ensure adherence to coding standards and best practices. Offer constructive feedback and identify potential security vulnerabilities in the codebase. Focus on maintaining code readability and facilitate discussions with team members to address any findings from the code review.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="4ifbk" data-offset-key="5fjf1-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="5fjf1-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="5fjf1-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Collaborate async across timezones with a fully-distributed team, working in the open on GitHub and in Slack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="4ifbk" data-offset-key="phju-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="phju-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="phju-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Partner closely with designers and product managers to apprehend user experience goals and translate their mockups into functional UI components. Ensure a consistent visual design across all UI elements. Participate in brainstorming sessions to generate innovative ideas for enhancing the user interface.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="5agq" data-offset-key="524h3-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="524h3-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="524h3-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Solid production experience with full-stack JavaScript, preferably TypeScript ; React on the front end and Node.js on the back end. Some experience with Reactflow is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="5agq" data-offset-key="14stj-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="14stj-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="14stj-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;A track record of leading non-trivial projects end-to-end, with real design ownership and minimal guidance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="5agq" data-offset-key="4ee9-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="4ee9-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="4ee9-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Proficient architecture and system-design judgment, including in large, existing codebases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="5agq" data-offset-key="ankh8-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="ankh8-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="ankh8-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Successfully designed and launched multiple user interface components that significantly increased user commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="5agq" data-offset-key="49vbs-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="49vbs-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="49vbs-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;You should have experience using AI-assisted development tools. These tools can help you develop features faster, fix complex systems, and improve existing codebases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="5agq" data-offset-key="arhui-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="arhui-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="arhui-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Exemplary written and verbal communication, and a genuine excitement for async collaboration and knowledge-sharing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="5agq" data-offset-key="58r80-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="58r80-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="58r80-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;A multiplier mindset ! you make the engineers around you better.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="5agq" data-offset-key="fgvt8-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="fgvt8-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="fgvt8-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;A generalist streak and a user-focused mindset, with consideration for the people using your software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="4ifbk" data-offset-key="273u-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="273u-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="273u-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Experience with the Elastic stack, observability tooling, or log/data-ingestion pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="4ifbk" data-offset-key="eta1o-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="eta1o-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="eta1o-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Go, Kubernetes, or cloud-native application development experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="4ifbk" data-offset-key="8pprh-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="8pprh-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="8pprh-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Experience building large user interfaces that manage a lot of data. This includes skills in search, filtering, and tables. You should also have experience working with streaming or real-time data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="4ifbk" data-offset-key="5p5jp-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="5p5jp-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="5p5jp-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Prior open-source / working-in-the-open experience, or time on a developer-facing platform team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="4ifbk" data-offset-key="7orvr-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="7orvr-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="7orvr-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Experience mentoring engineers or leading a small project team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class="gmail_default"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: #000000;"&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf" target="_blank"&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style="color: #000000;"&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #000000;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf" target="_blank"&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf" target="_blank"&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style="color: #000000;"&gt;Poster and &lt;a href="https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf" target="_blank"&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: #000000;"&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People's Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People's Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:tech-lead-android-core-product:
&lt;p&gt;The mission of Speechify is to make sure that reading is never a barrier to learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 50 million people use Speechify’s text-to-speech products to turn whatever they’re reading – PDFs, books, Google Docs, news articles, websites – into audio, so they can read faster, read more, and remember more. Speechify’s text-to-speech reading products include its iOS app, Android App, Mac App, Chrome Extension, and Web App. Google recently named Speechify the Chrome Extension of the Year and Apple named Speechify its Design award winner for inclusivity for 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, nearly 200 people around the globe work on Speechify in a 100% distributed setting – Speechify has no office. These include frontend and backend engineers, AI research scientists, and others from Amazon, Microsoft, and Google, leading PhD programs like Stanford, high growth startups like Stripe, Vercel, Bolt, and many founders of their own companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;With the growth of our Android app, being the most used text-to-speech app in the Play Store, we find the need for a Senior Android Engineer to help us support the new user base as well as work on new and exciting projects to push us forward. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;This is a key role and ideal for someone who thinks strategically, enjoys fast-paced environments, passionate about making product decisions, and has experience building great user experiences that delight users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;We are a flat organization that allows anyone to become a leader by showing excellent technical skills and delivering results consistently and fast. Work ethic, solid communication skills, and obsession with winning are paramount.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Our interview process involves several technical interviews and we aim to complete them within 1 week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Yo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;u’&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Owning major features and working closely with our design team - take ownership of features inside the app and become responsible of delivering high quality features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Shape the future of our Android team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Own, maintain and improve reliability metrics for key features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Participate in discussions across different teams - Product, Design, Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Review pull requests, and support other teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Handle critical issues or cope with unexpected challenges&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Take ownership of feature releases and provide nightly builds for the QA team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An Ideal Candidate Should Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;5+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Familiarity with Android components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Experience building or contributing to at least one Android app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Product design intuition and user empathy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Drive to push the boundaries of Android UI/UX&lt;/li&gt;
